                "description": "First Impressions CFMBP Victorian Rope Refrigerator Door Pull - This victorian design is reminiscent of the late 1800's,  elaborate yet graceful. Available in 4 standard lengths from 14 - 24 inches and 5 different finishes including Oil Rubbed Bronze and Aged Brass.",
